  "body": "Changes: Added a workflow that runs the ASF Infra allowlist-check action\n(apache/infrastructure-actions/allowlist-check). It verifies that every\n`uses:` ref under .github/ is on the ASF org-level allowlist.\n\nUnapproved action fails at PR time instead of causing a silent \"Startup\nfailure\" with no logs. It runs on PRs and pushes that touch .github/,\nplus weekly to catch allowlisted pins that expire.\n\nRef:\nhttps://github.com/apache/infrastructure-actions/tree/main/allowlist-check\nReviewers: Omnia Ibrahim <o.g.h.ibrahim@gmail.com>\n",
